# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every token is accounted for, always\", title"
msgid "Every token is accounted for, always"
msgstr "Cada ficha está registrada, siempre"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every token is accounted for, always\", plain"
msgid "All value in the village lives on one ledger where every movement has a source and a destination, and the books must balance to zero at every boot. If they ever don't, the village refuses to open until a human looks. Balances are recomputed from the record, never adjusted by hand."
msgstr "Todo el valor de la aldea vive en un solo libro mayor donde cada movimiento tiene un origen y un destino, y las cuentas deben sumar cero en cada arranque. Si alguna vez no cuadran, la aldea se niega a abrir hasta que una persona lo revise. Los saldos se recalculan a partir del registro, nunca se ajustan a mano."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every token is accounted for, always\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/ledger.ts: conservation invariant, checked at every boot"
msgstr "server/lib/ledger.ts: invariante de conservación, revisada en cada arranque"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Money flows in, never out\", title"
msgid "Money flows in, never out"
msgstr "El dinero entra, nunca sale"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Money flows in, never out\", plain"
msgid "Real money can buy the village's credit tokens, but no token can ever be sold back for money. There is no cash-out path, and adding one is not a setting: it is what keeps village credits from becoming securities."
msgstr "Con dinero real se pueden comprar las fichas de crédito de la aldea, pero ninguna ficha se puede volver a vender por dinero. No existe un camino para retirar efectivo, y agregar uno no es un ajuste: es lo que evita que los créditos de la aldea se vuelvan valores bursátiles."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Money flows in, never out\", enforcedBy"
msgid "No such code path exists; exchange is buy-only (server/lib/exchange.ts)"
msgstr "Ese camino de código no existe; el intercambio es solo de compra (server/lib/exchange.ts)"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Money flows in, never out\", whenModuleOff"
msgid "No token can ever be sold back for money. There is no cash-out path, and adding one is not a setting."
msgstr "Ninguna ficha se puede volver a vender por dinero. No existe un camino para retirar efectivo, y agregar uno no es un ajuste."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Recognition cannot be bought\", title"
msgid "Recognition cannot be bought"
msgstr "El reconocimiento no se puede comprar"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Recognition cannot be bought\", plain"
msgid "The recognition token exists only as a record of appreciation between people. It is never for sale, never tradeable, and never granted by anything except a human act. Appreciation with a price would just be a price."
msgstr "La ficha de reconocimiento existe solo como registro del aprecio entre personas. Nunca está a la venta, nunca se intercambia, y nunca la otorga otra cosa que un acto humano. Un aprecio con precio sería solo un precio."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Recognition cannot be bought\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/exchange.ts: recognition is refused from every listing and swap"
msgstr "server/lib/exchange.ts: el reconocimiento se rechaza en todo listado e intercambio"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"What the village can conjure can never claim what people paid for\", title"
msgid "What the village can conjure can never claim what people paid for"
msgstr "Lo que la aldea puede crear de la nada nunca puede reclamar lo que la gente pagó"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"What the village can conjure can never claim what people paid for\", plain"
msgid "Tokens the village issues freely (rewards, comps) can never be swapped into tokens that people bought with real money. The test is structural: it is about where tokens came from, and no privilege level overrides it."
msgstr "Las fichas que la aldea emite libremente (recompensas, cortesías) nunca se pueden intercambiar por fichas que la gente compró con dinero real. La prueba es estructural: trata de dónde vienen las fichas, y ningún nivel de privilegio la anula."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"What the village can conjure can never claim what people paid for\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/exchange.ts: faucet-issued tokens are permanently unswappable"
msgstr "server/lib/exchange.ts: las fichas emitidas por el grifo nunca se pueden intercambiar"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Your record is yours, and you choose how it becomes formal\", title"
msgid "Your record is yours, and you choose how it becomes formal"
msgstr "Su registro es suyo, y usted elige cómo se vuelve formal"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Your record is yours, and you choose how it becomes formal\", plain"
msgid "Every village keeps its own record here: what was decided, who decided it, and when. How that record becomes formal is the village's choice: a blockchain, legal documents, or both. Tokens governed on a chain live on that chain, and this platform reads them, displays them, and links you out to them. It never mints, moves, or prices them."
msgstr "Cada aldea guarda aquí su propio registro: qué se decidió, quién lo decidió y cuándo. Cómo se vuelve formal ese registro lo elige la aldea: una cadena de bloques, documentos legales, o ambos. Las fichas gobernadas en una cadena viven en esa cadena, y esta plataforma las lee, las muestra y le enlaza a ellas. Nunca las acuña, las mueve ni les pone precio."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Your record is yours, and you choose how it becomes formal\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/ledger.ts: chain-governed tokens are refused from the ledger entirely"
msgstr "server/lib/ledger.ts: las fichas gobernadas en cadena se rechazan del libro mayor por completo"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"The village decides where its decisions bind\", title"
msgid "The village decides where its decisions bind"
msgstr "La aldea decide dónde obligan sus decisiones"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"The village decides where its decisions bind\", plain"
msgid "A village can hold its votes here, or keep its formal record somewhere else. A vote held here binds here and stays on the record, with the count and the reasoning kept. A village that keeps its record elsewhere gets a game that prepares the decision and carries it there, and never one that claims to have made it."
msgstr "Una aldea puede hacer sus votaciones aquí, o llevar su registro formal en otro lugar. Una votación hecha aquí obliga aquí y queda en el registro, con el conteo y las razones guardados. Una aldea que lleva su registro en otro lugar recibe un juego que prepara la decisión y la lleva allá, y nunca uno que diga haberla tomado."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"The village decides where its decisions bind\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/ballots.ts: a ballot freezes its rule at open and closes by a human act; shared/modules.ts: the governance module ships off, so a village that never turns it on keeps its record where it always was"
msgstr "server/lib/ballots.ts: una votación congela su regla al abrirse y se cierra por un acto humano; shared/modules.ts: el módulo de gobernanza viene apagado, así una aldea que nunca lo enciende guarda su registro donde siempre estuvo"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"A vote is counted against the day it opened\", title"
msgid "A vote is counted against the day it opened"
msgstr "Una votación se cuenta según el día en que se abrió"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"A vote is counted against the day it opened\", plain"
msgid "When a ballot opens, its thresholds, its electorate and every voter's weight freeze inside it. No later change to any setting, allocation or balance rewrites a vote, open or closed. What you were asked, and what your voice weighed, is permanent from the moment the asking began."
msgstr "Cuando se abre una votación, sus umbrales, su padrón y el peso de cada votante se congelan dentro de ella. Ningún cambio posterior a un ajuste, una asignación o un saldo reescribe una votación, abierta o cerrada. Lo que se le preguntó, y cuánto pesó su voz, es permanente desde el momento en que empezó la pregunta."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"A vote is counted against the day it opened\", enforcedBy"
msgid "the ballots snapshot columns (drizzle/0089) + server/lib/ballots.test.ts"
msgstr "las columnas de fotografía de las votaciones (drizzle/0089) + server/lib/ballots.test.ts"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Voting weight is on the record\", title"
msgid "Voting weight is on the record"
msgstr "El peso del voto queda en el registro"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Voting weight is on the record\", plain"
msgid "Whatever weight mode the village runs, every member can see how voting weight is assigned, and every change to an assigned weight is a permanent record carrying who changed it and why. Weight is power, and this game holds no hidden power."
msgstr "Sea cual sea el modo de peso que use la aldea, cada miembro puede ver cómo se asigna el peso del voto, y cada cambio a un peso asignado es un registro permanente que dice quién lo cambió y por qué. El peso es poder, y este juego no guarda ningún poder oculto."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Voting weight is on the record\", enforcedBy"
msgid "governance_weight_changes (drizzle/0089), append-only, member-readable"
msgstr "governance_weight_changes (drizzle/0089), solo se agrega, y los miembros pueden leerlo"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"One gate decides every permission\", title"
msgid "One gate decides every permission"
msgstr "Una sola puerta decide cada permiso"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"One gate decides every permission\", plain"
msgid "Whether you can do something is decided by exactly one rule, in one place, in a fixed order: admins can always act; a standing warning overrides roles and stages; then roles, then badges, then your stage on the ladder. No feature may invent its own side-door."
msgstr "Si usted puede hacer algo lo decide exactamente una regla, en un solo lugar, en un orden fijo: las personas administradoras siempre pueden actuar; una advertencia vigente pesa más que los roles y las etapas; luego los roles, luego las insignias, luego su etapa en la escalera. Ninguna función puede inventar su propia puerta lateral."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"One gate decides every permission\", enforcedBy"
msgid "shared/capabilities.ts: hasCapability(), the one gate"
msgstr "shared/capabilities.ts: hasCapability(), la única puerta"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Value is released by human consent, never by a timer\", title"
msgid "Value is released by human consent, never by a timer"
msgstr "El valor se libera por consentimiento humano, nunca por un reloj"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Value is released by human consent, never by a timer\", plain"
msgid "Recognition lands when a person consents to someone's work, and cycles close when a human closes them. No scheduled job ever releases value or closes a cycle on its own."
msgstr "El reconocimiento llega cuando una persona da su consentimiento al trabajo de alguien, y los ciclos cierran cuando una persona los cierra. Ninguna tarea programada libera valor ni cierra un ciclo por su cuenta."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Value is released by human consent, never by a timer\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/scheduler.ts: the scheduler's charter, in code and comments"
msgstr "server/lib/scheduler.ts: el estatuto del programador de tareas, en el código y en los comentarios"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Nobody witnesses their own work (once the village is grown)\", title"
msgid "Nobody witnesses their own work (once the village is grown)"
msgstr "Nadie atestigua su propio trabajo (cuando la aldea ya creció)"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Nobody witnesses their own work (once the village is grown)\", plain"
msgid "You cannot consent to your own claim: someone else must witness the work. A founder building alone is exempt only before the village starts its Game and while it is smaller than the solo-founder window, and every such use is recorded."
msgstr "Usted no puede dar consentimiento a su propia toma: otra persona debe atestiguar el trabajo. Quien funda en solitario queda exento solo antes de que la aldea empiece su Juego y mientras sea más pequeña que la ventana de fundación en solitario, y cada uso así queda registrado."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Nobody witnesses their own work (once the village is grown)\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/index.ts: the consent route's self-consent guard"
msgstr "server/index.ts: la protección contra el autoconsentimiento en la ruta de consentimiento"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"The record of value is never deleted\", title"
msgid "The record of value is never deleted"
msgstr "El registro del valor nunca se borra"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"The record of value is never deleted\", plain"
msgid "Ledger rows, settlements and measured facts are never erased. Leaving the village anonymizes who you were; it does not rewrite what happened, because the books must stay explicable forever."
msgstr "Las filas del libro mayor, las liquidaciones y los hechos medidos nunca se borran. Salir de la aldea vuelve anónimo quién fue usted; no reescribe lo que pasó, porque las cuentas deben poder explicarse para siempre."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"The record of value is never deleted\", enforcedBy"
msgid "anonymizeMember and the retract-don't-delete contract (drizzle/0040)"
msgstr "anonymizeMember y el contrato de retractar sin borrar (drizzle/0040)"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every mechanic is bounded\", title"
msgid "Every mechanic is bounded"
msgstr "Cada mecánica tiene límites"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every mechanic is bounded\", plain"
msgid "Every tunable dial has a floor and a ceiling set by the platform. Governance can move a dial anywhere within its bounds; nothing can move the bounds themselves. The bounds are the safety envelope this constitution draws around the game."
msgstr "Cada dial ajustable tiene un piso y un techo que fija la plataforma. La gobernanza puede mover un dial a cualquier punto dentro de sus límites; nada puede mover los límites mismos. Los límites son la envoltura de seguridad que esta constitución dibuja alrededor del juego."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every mechanic is bounded\", enforcedBy"
msgid "shared/gameVariables.ts: min/max on every def, validated before every write"
msgstr "shared/gameVariables.ts: mínimo y máximo en cada definición, validados antes de cada escritura"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every change to the rules is on the record\", title"
msgid "Every change to the rules is on the record"
msgstr "Cada cambio a las reglas queda en el registro"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every change to the rules is on the record\", plain"
msgid "Any change to any mechanic, by an admin or by a passed proposal, is written to a permanent amendment ledger: what changed, from what to what, by whom, under which decision. The history is public."
msgstr "Cualquier cambio a cualquier mecánica, hecho por una persona administradora o por una propuesta aprobada, se escribe en un libro de enmiendas permanente: qué cambió, de qué a qué, quién lo hizo y bajo qué decisión. La historia es pública."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Every change to the rules is on the record\", enforcedBy"
msgid "mechanics_changes table (drizzle/0042) + the variables write path"
msgstr "la tabla mechanics_changes (drizzle/0042) + el camino de escritura de las variables"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Caps fail closed\", title"
msgid "Caps fail closed"
msgstr "Los topes fallan cerrados"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Caps fail closed\", plain"
msgid "Where a limit protects members' value (swap caps above all), an unset or zero limit means ZERO, never unlimited. A missing rule is a closed tap, not an open one."
msgstr "Donde un límite protege el valor de los miembros (los topes de intercambio por encima de todo), un límite sin definir o en cero significa CERO, nunca ilimitado. Una regla que falta es una llave cerrada, nunca una abierta."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Caps fail closed\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/exchange.ts: fail-closed swap caps"
msgstr "server/lib/exchange.ts: topes de intercambio que fallan cerrados"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Trading requires an informed, versioned yes\", title"
msgid "Trading requires an informed, versioned yes"
msgstr "Intercambiar requiere un sí informado y con versión"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Trading requires an informed, versioned yes\", plain"
msgid "Token trading is off until this village's founder reads and accepts the current legal terms, and it closes again automatically if the terms change. A village run on a shared password cannot enable it at all: money needs accountable humans."
msgstr "El intercambio de fichas está apagado hasta que quien fundó esta aldea lee y acepta los términos legales vigentes, y se vuelve a cerrar solo si los términos cambian. Una aldea que funciona con una contraseña compartida no puede encenderlo de ninguna manera: el dinero necesita personas que respondan por él."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Trading requires an informed, versioned yes\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/exchange.ts + shared/modules.ts: the version-stamped legal card"
msgstr "server/lib/exchange.ts + shared/modules.ts: la tarjeta legal con sello de versión"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Leaving well is guaranteed\", title"
msgid "Leaving well is guaranteed"
msgstr "Salir bien está garantizado"

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Leaving well is guaranteed\", plain"
msgid "Any member can see everything the village holds about them, take a copy, settle what is open, and leave. Their name is scrubbed everywhere while the village's shared record keeps its numbers. Departure is a supported path, not an escape."
msgstr "Cualquier miembro puede ver todo lo que la aldea guarda sobre él, llevarse una copia, cerrar lo pendiente, y salir. Su nombre se borra en todas partes mientras el registro compartido de la aldea conserva sus números. Irse es un camino con apoyo, y nunca una huida."

# needs-native-review: the constitution's laws, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsConstitutionWords.ts
msgctxt "constitution law \"Leaving well is guaranteed\", enforcedBy"
msgid "server/lib/exit.ts + /api/profile/export + anonymizeMember"
msgstr "server/lib/exit.ts + /api/profile/export + anonymizeMember"
